{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2021年，发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主壬水生于申月得令，年柱癸丑、时柱壬子，水势极旺，身强无疑。月柱庚申偏印生身，全局金水过旺，喜火土调候制衡。\n\n2021年辛丑，流年天干辛金为正印，地支丑土为正官。流年地支丑与命局年支丑、月支申（申丑暗合）、日支辰（辰丑相破）形成复杂关系，且丑为湿土，助水而不制水，反而加重水势。大运乙卯（2018-2027）伤官泄秀，但流年辛金克乙木，伤官受制，主才华、事业受阻。\n\n流年辛丑，天干辛金生壬水，印星过旺，主思虑过多、依赖心强，不利主动求财。地支丑土为官星，但被水势所困，官星无力，主事业压力大、易有官非或经营困境。且丑辰相破，破及日支夫妻宫、事业宫，主根基动摇。时柱壬子水势汹涌，流年丑土被水冲，财星（土）受损，主破财、资金链断裂。\n\n综合判断，2021年命主处于水旺无制、印重身强、财官受损之局，生意上必遭重大挫折，且无火调候，难以回暖，符合“生意下跌、资金周转不灵、倒闭”之象。选项B、C涉及意外或家人健康，虽流年有刑冲，但无明确凶星指向血光或丧母；选项D明显与命局水旺财弱相悖。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "f046f8191079c8a47c9c663fad1a34ff01be0a83f96da9755b1ecef5b28f9c5c", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_on_r0_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 6162, "response_id": "db950502-e66b-4629-8559-9b4427fcf7b5", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 471, "completion_tokens": 381, "total_tokens": 852, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 471}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disab